nt to hear that  they're paying the claims but as long as  corporate america says well we're just  passing the cost along to the insurance  company and when our premiums go up we  just pass that cost along to you the  consumer  some of the things that russell kenzier  says are not  easy to check but one of the things he  said when i first called him was that  peter when you start calling around  asking people for comment you know  they're going to just say  no thank you goodbye  that was one of the things that did did  in fact check out if you were to contact  any casino any grocery store any large  retail store any hospital and say i'm  doing a story about slips and falls i'd  like to get you know get you behind the  camera and talk about it you won't get a  return call they don't want to talk  about it  but why not i mean it's a big problem  and the reason they don't want to talk  about it is because if they talk about  it that means they know it's a problem  walmart had did not respond to comment  uh costco spokesperson said they had no  comment i contacted cna which is one of  the leading insurers of retailers they  initially agreed to take my questions  but then said  they had no comment  what is the definition of an accident if  you would say well we had an accident on  il3 a lady slipped and fell in some  water well first of all that's not an  accident that's an incident because  accidents are non-predictable and not  preventable from the minute we took our  first steps we all have personal  experience  falling slipping and falling and as we  age that comes back to haunt us elderly  people are just deadly deathly afraid  of slipping and falling they all know  somebody that's in a nursing home or  died had a hip replacement they lost  their life they lost the quality of life  because of a slip and fall so they they  are reluctant to leave the house they  don't want to go out because they're  afraid they might slip and fall what we  want to do is let these people let the  elderly americans live their life live a  full life go out  but that takes commitment that takes  industry commitment manufacturers of  floors have to buy into that message  they don't  [Music]  you

